    "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Edition</h1><p><strong>We are offering in-engine game file to the public, you can build you own game upon that. For more information please contact use Steam forum to contact me.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Important Notifications</i></strong></h2><strong>-- This is still a on-going project, does not represent the final quality.<br>-- Some assets come from the internet. <br>--The game will be free wo download and offering original in-engine progress documents.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>About the game</i></strong></h2>--High detailed design of map, featuring five different territories. <br>--Have a complete First person shooting system with both hand and gun animation.<br>--Now having more than 10 different weapons that fully animated and playable. <br>--Powered by Unreal Engine 4 with Ray-Trace ON.<br><strong>--Remastered Dust II A bomb site.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515760/extras/97beb0f79dd4c0c53a32db85bf627676.poster.avif?t=1611975038\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515760/extras/97beb0f79dd4c0c53a32db85bf627676.webm?t=1611975038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515760/extras/97beb0f79dd4c0c53a32db85bf627676.mp4?t=1611975038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>--Motion captured actions, animated first person arm movements and gun fire.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515760/extras/a5f0fcaf4b1de024a7b82e4416c18c97.poster.avif?t=1611975038\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515760/extras/a5f0fcaf4b1de024a7b82e4416c18c97.webm?t=1611975038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515760/extras/a5f0fcaf4b1de024a7b82e4416c18c97.mp4?t=1611975038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>--Flexible choice of attachments which you can custome your own weapon.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515760/extras/6dff010c53d4dd76bd0540a463ef18e3.avif?t=1611975038\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>More feature will be included soon.......</strong></h2></strong>",
